DriveHub – Car Rental Management System 

1. Project Description 

DriveHub is a web application that allows customers to rent cars online. Customers can browse available cars, make reservations, and manage their bookings. Employees manage cars and reservations, while administrators manage the entire system. 

2. User Roles & Permissions 

Admin 

Manage users 

Manage cars 

Manage reservations 

View reports 

Employee 

Add/Edit/Delete cars 

Approve or reject reservations 

Update car availability 

Customer 

Register & Login 

Browse cars 

Book a car 

View booking history 

Update profile 

 

